  "notes": {
    "m_dash": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "Motion · Dashboard\n\nCards blur-to-focus on open, 40ms stagger top to bottom.\n\nTick a task: the circle fills in 120ms, a strike-through draws left to right in 220ms, the text fades to grey, and after 600ms the row eases to the bottom.\n\nDock now: the pill morphs into the dock with a 450ms container transform. The thumbnail clock scales up into the full clock, and system bars hide at 60%.\n\nSheets rise on a soft spring (damping 0.9, about 320ms). The scrim fades to 60% black.",
      "w": 360,
      "x": 2460,
      "y": 1295
    },
    "m_dock": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "Motion · Dock\n\nMinute change: the old digit blurs out 6px and fades while the new one blurs in, 300ms.\n\nNotification: the strip rises 12dp and fades in over 280ms while the clock scales to 84% on the same spring. It leaves after 8s.\n\nBurn-in care: the whole clock drifts up to 3dp every minute.",
      "w": 360,
      "x": 1990,
      "y": 4260
    },
    "m_onb": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "Motion · Onboarding\n\nScreens advance with a shared-axis slide: 32dp on x plus a fade, 300ms, emphasized decelerate.\n\nContent arrives blur-to-focus: blur 12→0, opacity 0→1, 260ms, 40ms stagger.\n\nAllow: the button collapses into a check and the card settles, 200ms.\n\nCarousel snaps on a critically damped spring with no overshoot.",
      "w": 360,
      "x": 1968,
      "y": 0
    },
    "m_set": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "Motion · Settings\n\nToggles: the thumb slides on a 220ms spring and the track colour crossfades.\n\nApp picker: checking the third app dims the rest to 35% over 180ms. Unchecking restores them.\n\nTemplates: the centre card sits at 100%, neighbours at 88% scale and 40% opacity, interpolated with scroll.",
      "w": 360,
      "x": 2460,
      "y": 2965
    },
